{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]The law of the LORD is per[Gm]fect, reviving the [Eb]soul
More desirable than gold, than much [Bb]pure gold
Sweeter than [Eb]honey, than honey from the [F]comb
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
May the [Eb]words of my mouth and the meditation of my [Gm]heart
Be [Eb]pleasing in your sight, O LORD, my [F]rock and my [Gm]redeemer
{end_of_verse}

